@SYSTEM_TITLE
; `全角スペースをホワイトスペースに含める` is on in every corpus config, so
; U+3000 is whitespace everywhere U+0020 is: Emuera's `SkipWhiteSpace`
; (`Sub/LexicalAnalyzer.cs:749-752`) and `ReadSingleIdentifier`
; (`:429-432`) both treat it that way. `#DIM DYNAMIC　L_ACTOR` is
; `FORMATION.ERB:419` and `IF ASSI　!= L_MOTHER` is `EVENT_P.ERB:135`.
#DIM DYNAMIC　L_ACTOR
#DIMS DYNAMIC　L_NAME
　PRINTL head
PRINTFORML　{1 + 1}
L_ACTOR　=　3
SIF L_ACTOR　!= 4
　PRINTL ne
L_NAME = mid
CALL SUB,　7,　8
　
PRINTFORML %L_NAME%
PRINTL tail

@SUB, ARG, ARG:1
PRINTFORML {ARG}{ARG:1}
